# Honesty and docs

- Record actual commands and outcomes (pass/fail/skip with reason).
- Update `docs/PROGRESS.md` when a phase starts or finishes.
- Log architectural choices in `docs/DECISIONS.md` (date + why).
- Known bugs go to `docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`; do not hide flaky results.
- Prefer fixing a broken build over adding new features.
